      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu aFwilistinu hiyakupompesha pompesha njita jawu jejima kuAfweki, aIsarela niwena nawa hiyakushila chilombu chawukukaseloki kekala kuYezereyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayilolu awaFwilistinu hiyakuhita ahamakulakaji, aha makombakaji, Davidi niyena niantu indi hiyakuhita munjitayakunyima hamu naAkisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulamba twawaFwilistinu hiyakwilanawu, Awa aHeberu analondidi kunu? Akisha hakuyila atulamba twawaFwilistinu nindi, Hidiyi Davidi kambuŋa mwanta wawaIsarela Sawuluku? Twashakama dehi nindi mafuku awa hela nyaka iyuku? Saŋa enjilayihinamoni chuma kudi yenaku kushika nikulelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulamba twawa-Fwilistinu hiyakumuzuwila, atulamba twawaFwilistinu hiyakumwila nawu, Iwu iyala mufuntishi, afunti cheŋi kwindi kuwamukunjika dehi, bayi tuyanindi kunjitaku, wakenza kela kunjita hakubalumuka hakekala chilumbuchetu, ochu hakatiyaŋenayi namwanta windi hacheŋi? Hihohanyituyanawa antu etuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hidiyi Davidi embiluwu hahaŋenuwu, heliluwu awanakutumbula awa nakwakwijia, hiyakwila nawu, Sawulu najahi makombakaji indi, Davidi najahi makumi indi amakombakajuku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisha hakumutambika Davidi, hakumwila nindi, Chahandayi Yehova kwaamu, muwunendeli nanami munjita nikuya nikwinza wumuntu woloka, nakumoni kuwaha hohu; chochiwenjili kudami kushika nikulelu hinamonimudeyi katamaku, hela chochu atulamba hiyanakutiyi kuwahaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichidinu funtaku, wuyi chachiwahi, wakenza katamisha nyichima yawatulambatwa waFwilistinu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi hakumwila Akisha nindi, Ochu ami neliŋahi? Munashakamini ami kambuŋeyi naneyi mwejimimu wunanmoninachumanyi mwaka nibuli kuya nakulwa nawayilumbu jankaka yami mwanta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisha hakwakula, hakumwila Davidi nindi, Ami neluki tuhu, nakumoni kuwaha neyi chikwakaŋelu kaNzambi, hela chochu tuhu, atulamba twawaFwilistinu anahoshi dehi nawu, Bayi tuya nindi kunjitaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu kameneki kweyi budidi hamu nawambuŋa mwanta weyi iwunenzi nawu, chimwakahinduka budidi, neyi kuneli dehi to-o himwakaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Davidi niantu indi hiyakumeneka budidi, hiyakuya, hiyakufunta mwituŋa dawaFwilistinu. AFwilistinu hiyakuya kuYezereyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
